\section{Definition}{


The metric is calculated for each class \eqn{k} as follows,

\deqn{
  \frac{\#TN_k}{\#TN_k + \#FN_k}
}

Where \eqn{\#TN_k} and \eqn{\#FN_k} are the number of true negatives and false negatives, respectively, for each class \eqn{k}.
}

